      "body": "Confirming from the code, and it is a bit stronger than the issue says: the missing body is not the only problem. `mergePR` (`packages/mobile/lib/api.ts:773`) is reached only through `store.merge` (`store.tsx:458`, exposed on the context at `:85`), and no component destructures `merge` from `useApp()` \u2014 there is no merge control anywhere in `packages/mobile`. So the path is unreachable rather than merely malformed, which lines up with the decision not to offer merging from the phone.\n\nClosing as stale. If you want the dead path gone I can send a small mobile-only PR deleting `mergePR` and `store.merge`; leaving it in place otherwise, since you mentioned the new version may revisit this.",
